Package: vijPlots
Type: Package
Title: vijPlots: Yet Another jamovi Plotting Module
Version: 1.3.2
Author: Vincent Jalby
Maintainer: Vincent Jalby <vincent.jalby@unilim.fr>
Description: Main statistical charts for continuous variables (Histogram, Box plot,
    Raincloud plot, Scatter plot, Error bar chart, Lollipop plot, QQ plot), for
    categorical variables (Bar plot, Pie chart, Mosaic plot, Likert plot), for 
    time series (Line chart, Area chart), along with Multiple Response plots. 
    All plots are built with ggplot2 and offer extensive customization options. 
License: GPL (>=3)
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
### labelled, fitdistrplus, Hmisc: not called directly, but required at runtime by ggstats/ggh4x/ggplot2 respectively
Imports: jmvcore (>= 0.8.5), R6, utils, stats, grDevices, psych, MASS, tidyr, dplyr,
         tibble, tidyselect,  forcats, grid, rlang, ggplot2, scales, ggstats,
         ggh4x, ggdist, ggpp, ggrepel, ggforce, dichromat, colorspace,
         qqplotr, GPArotation, FactoMineR,
         labelled, fitdistrplus, Hmisc
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    vdiffr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/vjalby/vijPlots
BugReports: https://github.com/vjalby/vijPlots/issues
